  "tech": "fast-steps-slopes",
  "techNote": "A staircase of 10 steps 64 wide and 32 tall (the game's slopes are this: Area 1's ground has 140 such 64x32 steps), 320 u up to a platform with the finish box. Hold right: Movement.Update's step-up (806-816: ground at least 230 u/s sideways, not rising, the down ray from (x+27, y+10) finds a top 13-44 u above the feet and the wall rays at y+10 and y+19 miss) teleports the dot onto every step (y = top + 36) without leaving the ground, one step every 7 ticks at the full 460 u/s: the finish on tick 102. No jump, and no jump could do it faster (the step-ups keep the full run speed); the highest NONE jump from the floor lifts the feet about 258 u, under the 320 u top.",
